{"meta":{"ui":"order_summary","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"retry","prompt":"Show my grocery order as an inline card before you place it: five line items with a picture placeholder, price and a quantity I can raise or lower (removing at zero), a promo code field that takes SAVE10, the subtotal, delivery and total kept up to date, and confirm and cancel buttons that tell you what I decided.","text":"ChatCard \"Grocery order\" \"5 items\" icon:\"shopping_cart\" status:\"Review\" tone:accent\n  state items=[{\"id\":1,\"title\":\"Bananas\",\"detail\":\"1 bunch\",\"price\":2.4,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"banana\"},{\"id\":2,\"title\":\"Whole milk\",\"detail\":\"1 L\",\"price\":1.6,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"milk\"},{\"id\":3,\"title\":\"Sourdough loaf\",\"detail\":\"Bakery\",\"price\":4.5,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"bread\"},{\"id\":4,\"title\":\"Free range eggs\",\"detail\":\"12 pack\",\"price\":3.8,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"eggs\"},{\"id\":5,\"title\":\"Cheddar\",\"detail\":\"400 g\",\"price\":5.2,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"cheese\"}]\n  state promo=\"\"\n  state applied=false\n  state decided=\"\"\n  each item in items\n    CartLine title:item.title detail:item.detail price:item.price qty:item.qty kind:item.kind -> items=updateWhere(items,x=>x.id==item.id,x=>with(x,\"qty\",result))\n  Row gap:8\n    InputField \"Promo code\" \"Enter code\" =promo\n    ActionButton \"Apply\" quiet -> applied=upper(trim(promo))==\"SAVE10\"\n  if applied\n    Callout \"Promo applied\" \"SAVE10 takes 10% off the subtotal.\" tone:good icon:\"check_circle\"\n  Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\",money(sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty),\"$\",2)],[\"Discount\",applied?money(-0.1*sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty),\"$\",2):\"\"],[\"Delivery\",\"$3.99\"],[\"Total\",money(sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty)*(applied?0.9:1)+3.99,\"$\",2)]]\n  if decided==\"\"\n    Row gap:10\n      ActionButton \"Cancel\" quiet icon:\"close\" -> decided=\"cancelled\"\n      ActionButton \"Confirm order\" primary icon:\"check\" enabled:=length(items)>0 -> decided=\"confirmed\"; emit placeOrder\n  if decided==\"confirmed\"\n    Receipt \"Order placed\" \"Your groceries are on the way.\" tone:good icon:\"check_circle\"\n  if decided==\"cancelled\"\n    Receipt \"Order cancelled\" \"Nothing was charged.\" tone:neutral icon:\"cancel\"","usage":{"input_tokens":10028,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":830,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":1239,"totalMs":3407}}
